    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">Ophir Sternberg, Lionheart&#8217;s Chairman, President and Chief
    Executive Officer, is the member of the Sponsor. Mr. Sternberg disclaims beneficial ownership over any securities owned by the Sponsor
    in which he does not have any pecuniary interest. Include 730 fully vested options that settle into Ordinary Shares upon paying exercise
    price of $342.35 per option.</span></td></tr>
