                                            (SECURITY MATTERS) PUBLIC LIMITED COMPANY</b></span></p>
                                                                                <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
                                            TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>
                                                                                <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>(US$
                                            in thousands)</b></span></p></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 15%; text-align: right"><img src="form20-fa_001.jpg" alt=""/></td></tr>
