</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001873" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfBorrowingsExplanatory"><p id="xdx_80E_eifrs-full--DisclosureOfBorrowingsExplanatory_zkEU7BowTLS2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 16 - <span id="xdx_82E_zoodeTjQUu35">BORROWINGS FROM RELATED PARTIES</span>:</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">A. In 2015,
the Group signed an agreement to receive a loan of ILS <span id="xdx_907_eifrs-full--CashAdvancesAndLoansFromRelatedParties_pn6n6_uILS_c20150101__20151231__ifrs-full--CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis__custom--ShareholdersMember_zuNuGkUTHls4" title="Loan from shareholders"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:CashAdvancesAndLoansFromRelatedParties" contextRef="From2015-01-012015-12-31_custom_ShareholdersMember" id="Fact001875" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="ILS">2</ix:nonFraction></span> million (approximately $<span id="xdx_900_eifrs-full--CashAdvancesAndLoansFromRelatedParties_pn3n3_c20150101__20151231__ifrs-full--CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis__custom--ShareholdersMember_zlxNXcEQeVj2" title="Loan from shareholders"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:CashAdvancesAndLoansFromRelatedParties" contextRef="From2015-01-012015-12-31_custom_ShareholdersMember" id="Fact001877" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">513</ix:nonFraction></span>) from certain shareholders. These
loan bears interest at an annual rate of <span id="xdx_90E_eifrs-full--BorrowingsInterestRate_iI_dp_uPure_c20241231__ifrs-full--CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis__custom--ShareholdersMember_zN5ttj6SSB0b" title="Iinterest rate percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_ShareholdersMember" id="Fact001879" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001881" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsExplanatory"><p id="xdx_895_eifrs-full--DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsExplanatory_zWEi1jpb9sDe" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;<span id="xdx_8BE_zbu6e7dbuCK5" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF BORROWINGS FROM RELATED PARTIES</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"></p>

