<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">1.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">The Company is incorporated and domiciled in Ireland where the applicable tax rate is <span id="xdx_906_eifrs-full--ApplicableTaxRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20240101__20241231_zkZzNd96K6pj"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:ApplicableTaxRate" contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" id="Fact002445" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">12.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">&#160;</p>

