    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>SMX (SECURITY MATTERS) PUBLIC
    LIMITED COMPANY</b></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL
    STATEMENTS<span style="font-size: 11pt"></span></b></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>(US$ in thousands)</b></p></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 15%; text-align: right"><img src="form20-fa_001.jpg" alt=""/></td></tr>
