<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left"><b></b></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A4_zWA4Bep5CME8" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact002883" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory"><p id="xdx_806_eifrs-full--DisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory_znAoBaGHHR1" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 28 - <span id="xdx_829_zczfmURVBpGl">SUBSEQUENT EVENTS</span>:</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">Since the reporting date the following
significant events have occurred:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">1.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">On December 30 and 31, 2024, some of the option warrant A holders as part of the September 11, 2024 Aegis
transaction submitted an exercise instruction to convert the option warrants into shares, in exchange for an exercise addition of $<span id="xdx_904_eifrs-full--ProceedsFromExerciseOfWarrants_pn3n3_c20250102__20250102__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember_zmqGRzAYoCQk" title="Warrant exercise addition value"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromExerciseOfWarrants" contextRef="From2025-01-022025-01-02_custom_NonadjustingEventMember" id="Fact002885" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">1,510</ix:nonFraction></span>,
which was transferred to the Company&#8217;s bank account only on January 2, 2025. The company had no technical ability to withdraw from
its obligation to issue the shares once the exercise notice was received from the warrant holders and recorded the proceeds towards Other
Current assets.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">2.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">After
                                            balance sheet date and until the date of the authorization of these financial statements
                                            the Company repaid $<span id="xdx_904_eifrs-full--RepaymentsOfBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities_pn3n3_c20250101__20250430__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--BorrowingsByNameAxis__custom--BridgeLoansMember_zMPTBYmLXcx4" title="Debt repaid"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RepaymentsOfBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-04-30_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_BridgeLoansMember" id="Fact002887" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">250</ix:nonFraction></span> of the Bridge Loans and $<span id="xdx_904_eifrs-full--RepaymentsOfBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities_pn3n3_c20250101__20250430__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--BorrowingsByNameAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember_z4aUF5KZn6V4" title="Debt repaid"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RepaymentsOfBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-04-30_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember" id="Fact002889" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">185</ix:nonFraction></span> of the Promissory Note.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">3.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">On February 21, 2025, the Company filed a &#8220;shelf&#8221; registration statement on Form F-3 with the U.S. Securities and Exchange
Commission, registering for sale from time to time, up to $45,000 of any combination of the securities described in the Form F-3, either
individually or in units. The Company may also offer ordinary shares or preferred shares upon conversion of debt securities, ordinary
shares upon conversion of preferred shares, or ordinary shares, preferred shares or debt securities upon the exercise of warrants or rights.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">4.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">On February 24, 2025, the Company amended its 2022 Incentive Equity Plan (the &#8220;Incentive Plan&#8221;),
to increase the number of authorized Ordinary Shares under the Incentive Plan to <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement_iI_pid_c20250224__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfContractsAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember_zgflRbq79Vs2" title="Number of authorized ordinary shares"><ix:nonFraction name="SMX:NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" contextRef="AsOf2025-02-24_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember" id="Fact002891" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,396,668</ix:nonFraction></span> from <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement_iI_pid_c20250223__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfContractsAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember_ztCUjuesjyWg" title="Number of authorized ordinary shares"><ix:nonFraction name="SMX:NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" contextRef="AsOf2025-02-23_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember" id="Fact002893" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">111,668</ix:nonFraction></span> (the &#8220;Amendment&#8221;).
As a Foreign Private Issuer, Nasdaq Rule 5615(a)(3) allows the Company to rely on home country corporate governance practices in lieu
of certain of the rules in the Nasdaq Rule 5600 Series and Rule 5250(d) and, accordingly, the Company so elected to approve the Amendment
without stockholder approval. Thereafter, the Company granted an aggregate of <span id="xdx_908_eifrs-full--NumberOfShareOptionsGrantedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement_pid_uShares_c20250224__20250224__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfContractsAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis__ifrs-full--ShareOptionsMember_z41sgV8TD9Nj" title="Number of fully vested stock options granted"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NumberOfShareOptionsGrantedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" contextRef="From2025-02-242025-02-24_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember_ifrs-full_ShareOptionsMember" id="Fact002895" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,215,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units and <span id="xdx_90A_eifrs-full--NumberOfInstrumentsOtherEquityInstrumentsGranted_pid_uShares_c20250224__20250224__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis__ifrs-full--RestrictedShareUnitsMember_zCTmtlkYNTwa" title="Number of fully vested restricted stock units granted"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NumberOfInstrumentsOtherEquityInstrumentsGranted" contextRef="From2025-02-242025-02-24_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_ifrs-full_RestrictedShareUnitsMember" id="Fact002897" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,070,000</ix:nonFraction></span> stock options to its executive officers and directors, and to certain consultants and advisors to the Company.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">5.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">On March 17, 2025, the Company amended its 2022 Incentive Equity Plan (the &#8220;Incentive Plan&#8221;),
to increase the number of authorized Ordinary Shares under the Incentive Plan to <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement_iI_pid_c20250317__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfContractsAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember_zuOKumWOOMA2" title="Number of authorized ordinary shares"><ix:nonFraction name="SMX:NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" contextRef="AsOf2025-03-17_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember" id="Fact002899" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,531,668</ix:nonFraction></span> from <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement_iI_pid_c20250316__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfContractsAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember_zuSPi24vDZqf" title="Number of authorized ordinary shares"><ix:nonFraction name="SMX:NumberOfInstrumentsAuthorizedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" contextRef="AsOf2025-03-16_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember" id="Fact002901" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,396,668</ix:nonFraction></span> (the &#8220;Amendment&#8221;).
As a Foreign Private Issuer, Nasdaq Rule 5615(a)(3) allows the Company to rely on home country corporate governance practices in lieu
of certain of the rules in the Nasdaq Rule 5600 Series and Rule 5250(d) and, accordingly, the Company so elected to approve the Amendment
without stockholder approval. Thereafter, the Company granted <span id="xdx_90F_eifrs-full--NumberOfShareOptionsGrantedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement_pid_uShares_c20250317__20250317__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__custom--NonadjustingEventMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfContractsAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember__ifrs-full--TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis__ifrs-full--ShareOptionsMember_zf2Dh1JO8BY2" title="Number of authorized ordinary shares"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NumberOfShareOptionsGrantedInSharebasedPaymentArrangement" contextRef="From2025-03-172025-03-17_custom_NonadjustingEventMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoIncentiveEquityPlanMember_ifrs-full_ShareOptionsMember" id="Fact002903" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">135,000</ix:nonFraction></span> half immediately and half vested on June 1, 2025, stock options
to certain consultants and advisors to the Company.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p>


