May 28, 2024, the Company issued 103,373 Ordinary Shares (pre-75:1 and 28.5 and 4.1 reverse stock split) to an institutional investor
upon the conversion of $169,305 in accrued interest under a convertible promissory note.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

