<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On February 24, 2025, the
Company issued an aggregate of 1,215,000 restricted stock units and an aggregate of 1,070,000 stock options, to its executive officers
and directors, and to certain consultants, employees and advisors to the Company.</p>

